---
const shaderPath = '/kodex/shaders/kdx-signal-convergence.fs';
---

<section class="kdx-nodalin" data-kdx-nodalin-bridge aria-labelledby="kdx-nodalin-heading">
  <details>
    <summary>
      <span id="kdx-nodalin-heading">EXPERIMENT 001.B / NODALIN VISUAL BRIDGE</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </summary>
    <div class="bridge-content">
      <div class="bridge-meta"><span>OPTIONAL / THIRD-PARTY RENDERER</span><span>NOT CANON · NOT DEPLOYED</span></div>
      <h2>Una segunda superficie.<br /><em>La misma pregunta.</em></h2>
      <p class="bridge-lead">
        Conecta una composición pública creada en Nodalin como vista experimental.
        El campo SVG de KODEX y su fuente documentada siguen funcionando independientemente.
        Este puente no sincroniza parámetros, navegación ni memoria entre sistemas.
      </p>
      <div class="bridge-sources">
        <a href={shaderPath} download="kdx-signal-convergence.fs">DESCARGAR SHADER ISF ORIGINAL ↗</a>
        <p>El shader es un experimento propio con control manual de convergencia. Su importación específica en Nodalin debe verificarse. No registra audio ni señales biológicas.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="bridge-form" id="kdx-nodalin-form">
        <label for="kdx-nodalin-url">URL pública de Embed / Share de Nodalin</label>
        <div class="bridge-entry">
          <input
            id="kdx-nodalin-url"
            type="url"
            name="nodalin-embed-url"
            inputmode="url"
            autocomplete="off"
            spellcheck="false"
            placeholder="https://app.nodalin.app/…"
            aria-describedby="kdx-nodalin-help"
            required
          />
          <button type="submit">ABRIR VISTA ↗</button>
        </div>
        <p id="kdx-nodalin-help">
          Copia la URL pública del iframe compartido desde Nodalin, no el enlace /start del editor.
          La composición externa solo se solicita cuando pulses «Abrir vista».
        </p>
      </form>
      <p class="bridge-status" id="kdx-nodalin-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        Sin conexión externa. Se mantiene la visualización SVG propia de KODEX.
      </p>
      <div class="bridge-viewport" id="kdx-nodalin-viewport" hidden>
        <div class="viewport-controls">
          <span>NODALIN / EMBED EXTERNO</span>
          <div>
            <a id="kdx-nodalin-external" href="https://nodalin.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ABRIR EN NODALIN ↗</a>
            <button id="kdx-nodalin-disconnect" type="button">DESCONECTAR ×</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <iframe
          id="kdx-nodalin-frame"
          title="Composición experimental externa de Nodalin"
          loading="lazy"
          referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
          sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-pointer-lock"
          allow="fullscreen"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="bridge-legal">
        Si la vista externa aparece vacía, revisa que Nodalin permita incrustarla y que el proyecto sea público.
        KODEX no modifica archivos de Nodalin, no recopila su actividad y no garantiza compatibilidad con todos los embeds.
        Para un uso comercial de Nodalin, verificar su licencia.
      </p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
  .kdx-nodalin { margin: 64px 0 0; color: #e9e8e3; font-family: "Instrument Sans",Arial,sans-serif; }
  .kdx-nodalin details { border: 1px solid #343842; background: #0e1119; }
  .kdx-nodalin summary { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; cursor: pointer; padding: 21px 24px; color: #bcbfce; letter-spacing: .15em; font: 11px ui-monospace,monospace; list-style: none; }
  .kdx-nodalin summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .kdx-nodalin summary > span:last-child { font-size: 17px; color: #e6bc9f; }
  .kdx-nodalin summary:hover { background: #151923; }
  .bridge-content { padding: clamp(20px,4vw,52px); border-top: 1px solid #343842; }
  .bridge-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; color: #9298ad; font: 10px ui-monospace,monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .bridge-content h2 { font-size: clamp(32px,5vw,64px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.065em; margin: 42px 0 26px; }
  .bridge-content h2 em { font-style: normal; color: #b4abcc; }
  .bridge-lead { max-width: 710px; color: #b0b1c0; line-height: 1.65; font-size: 15px; }
  .bridge-sources { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 22px 0; border-block: 1px solid #343842; }
  .bridge-sources a { padding: 13px 16px; color: #f4e0cc; border: 1px solid #887c82; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; font: 11px ui-monospace,monospace; letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .bridge-sources p { margin: 0; max-width: 520px; color: #969bab; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .bridge-form { margin-top: 34px; }
  .bridge-form label { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #d4d5dd; font: 11px ui-monospace,monospace; letter-spacing: .075em; }
  .bridge-entry { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .bridge-entry input { min-width: 0; flex: 1; min-height: 52px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #5e6070; border-radius: 0; color: #e8e9f0; background: #171b26; padding: 0 15px; font: 13px ui-monospace,monospace; }
  .bridge-entry button { min-height: 52px; border: 0; border-radius: 0; background: #ded4c9; color: #171922; padding: 0 20px; cursor: pointer; font: 11px ui-monospace,monospace; font-weight: 700; }
  .bridge-form > p, .bridge-legal { font-size: 12px; color: #979dab; line-height: 1.6; }
  .bridge-status { margin: 24px 0; color: #c6b6a6; font: 11px ui-monospace,monospace; line-height: 1.5; }
  .bridge-viewport { border: 1px solid #525869; background: #05070b; margin: 24px 0; }
  .bridge-viewport[hidden] { display: none; }
  .viewport-controls { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; padding: 13px 16px; color: #b0b7c9; font: 10px ui-monospace,monospace; border-bottom: 1px solid #303849; }
  .viewport-controls > div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .viewport-controls a, .viewport-controls button { font: inherit; color: #f0d0b3; text-decoration: none; background: transparent; border: 0; cursor: pointer; padding: 7px 0; }
  .bridge-viewport iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: min(70vh,620px); min-height: 300px; border: none; }
  .kdx-nodalin summary:focus-visible, .kdx-nodalin input:focus-visible, .kdx-nodalin button:focus-visible, .kdx-nodalin a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #f1d0ad; outline-offset: 3px; }
  @media(max-width:640px) { .kdx-nodalin { margin-top: 42px; } .kdx-nodalin summary { padding: 18px 13px; font-size: 9px; } .bridge-entry { flex-direction: column; } .bridge-entry button { width: 100%; } .bridge-meta { font-size: 9px; } .bridge-viewport iframe { height: 60svh; min-height: 300px; } .bridge-content h2 { margin-top: 32px; } }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .kdx-nodalin * { scroll-behavior: auto !important; animation: none !important; transition: none !important; } }
</style>

<script is:inline>
  (() => {
    const root = document.querySelector('[data-kdx-nodalin-bridge]');
    if (!root) return;
    const form = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-form');
    const input = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-url');
    const status = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-status');
    const viewport = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-viewport');
    const frame = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-frame');
    const external = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-external');
    const disconnect = root.querySelector('#kdx-nodalin-disconnect');
    if (!form || !input || !status || !viewport || !frame || !external || !disconnect) return;

    function validatePublicUrl(value) {
      const url = new URL(value.trim());
      const host = url.hostname.toLowerCase();
      const isNodalin = host === 'nodalin.app' || host.endsWith('.nodalin.app');
      if (url.protocol !== 'https:' || !isNodalin) {
        throw new Error('Solo se permite una URL HTTPS del dominio Nodalin.');
      }
      if (url.pathname === '/' || /^\/(start|login)(\/|$)/i.test(url.pathname)) {
        throw new Error('Necesitas una URL pública de Share / Embed, no el inicio del editor.');
      }
      if (url.username || url.password) {
        throw new Error('No pegues direcciones con credenciales.');
      }
      return url.href;
    }

    form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      let url;
      try {
        url = validatePublicUrl(input.value);
      } catch (error) {
        status.textContent = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Enlace no válido.';
        return;
      }
      external.href = url;
      frame.src = url;
      viewport.hidden = false;
      status.textContent = 'Se solicitó la vista externa. Comprueba que el embed aparece; esto no confirma una integración bidireccional.';
    });

    disconnect.addEventListener('click', () => {
      frame.removeAttribute('src');
      viewport.hidden = true;
      external.href = 'https://nodalin.app/';
      status.textContent = 'Vista desconectada. El experimento SVG nativo no se ha modificado.';
      input.focus();
    });
  })();
</script>
